<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Semantic Tags Demo</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
        }
        header, nav, main, section, footer {
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 10px;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
        header {
            background-color: #4CAF50;
            color: white;
        }
        nav {
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
        }
        main {
            background-color: #ffffff;
        }
        section {
            background-color: #e9e9e9;
        }
        footer {
            background-color: #333;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
        }
        figure {
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Header -->
    <header>
        <h1>My Website</h1>
        <p>Welcome to the semantic HTML demo</p>
    </header>

    <!-- Navigation -->
    <nav>
        <a href="#">Home</a> |
        <a href="#">About</a> |
        <a href="#">Contact</a>
    </nav>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <main>

        <!-- Section -->
        <section>
            <h2>About Semantic Tags</h2>
            <p>Semantic tags clearly describe their meaning in a human- and machine-readable way.</p>

            <!-- Details & Summary -->
            <details>
                <summary>Click to learn more</summary>
                <p>HTML5 introduced semantic elements like header, nav, main, section, and footer to improve readability and SEO.</p>
            </details>
        </section>

        <!-- Section with Figure -->
        <section>
            <h2>Example Image</h2>

            <figure>
                <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/300" alt="Sample Image">
                <figcaption>This is a sample figure caption.</figcaption>
            </figure>

        </section>

    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 My Website</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
